sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Follow a camper at camp
    %% Stories: 37, 40, 43, 44, 48
    %% Description: A parent follows the child's schedule and assigned counselors, checks the payments and shares photos.
    actor PA as Parent
    participant GD as Guardian
    participant CA as Camper
    participant GR as Group
    participant SC as Schedule
    participant CS as Counselor
